      "message": "Use the SPDX identifier Apache-2.0 in license declarations (#1013)\n\nThe <license> tags in package.xml and the license= fields in setup.py\nspelled the license as prose (\"Apache License 2.0\", \"Apache License,\nVersion 2.0\", \"Apache 2.0\"). Use the SPDX identifier instead so the\ndeclaration can be matched mechanically. The license itself does not\nchange.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5 [git, gh]\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Carroll <mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com>",
